00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:05.340
God has created us in his image

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:08.850
and I don't think we should
change the way we are.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:12.483
- [Narrator] Owning a gun
is a basic human right.

00:11:19.830 --> 00:11:22.680
- I absolutely hate hearing
about school shootings

00:11:22.680 --> 00:11:26.610
on the news, and just shootings
in general, it's horrible.

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:30.060
This isn't like, Spider-Man's
not gonna save people,

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:32.940
people have the right
to protect themselves.

00:11:32.940 --> 00:11:35.430
- A lot of mass shooters
target gun-free zones

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:36.960
because they know there's
not gonna be a person

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:39.930
who's going to fight against
them, or shoot them back.

00:11:39.930 --> 00:11:41.730
There's a lot of mass
shootings at schools,

00:11:41.730 --> 00:11:44.400
and that's because schools
have gun free zones.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:47.160
I view owning a gun as a
right to defend myself.

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:50.040
You look at countries that
have banned guns in the past,

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.140
the USSR, Nazi Germany.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.330
You look at China under Mao Zedong,

00:11:54.330 --> 00:11:57.030
they strip their citizens of arms

00:11:57.030 --> 00:11:58.830
so they could oppress them.

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:01.560
And I think the reason
why our founding fathers

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:03.090
enshrined the second amendment,

00:12:03.090 --> 00:12:05.400
is because they wanted
us to protect ourselves

00:12:05.400 --> 00:12:06.630
against tyrannical government,

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:09.690
and to protect ourselves
against danger around us too.

00:12:09.690 --> 00:12:12.510
- I think that, from
a woman's perspective,

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.570
if, as a woman, you get
into a dangerous situation,

00:12:15.570 --> 00:12:17.400
for example, with a man, having a gun

00:12:17.400 --> 00:12:18.720
and knowing how to use a gun,

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:20.370
is the only way that will protect me.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:24.030
Having my tiny little pepper
spray won't help me forever.

00:12:24.030 --> 00:12:26.340
I think definitely if you take away guns,

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.625
the bad guys will always get
their guns one way or another.

00:12:28.625 --> 00:12:32.670
- I live in Los Angeles, and
LA has strict gun control laws.

00:12:32.670 --> 00:12:33.870
This is my perspective of it.

00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.600
I think LA has become
a more dangerous city,

00:12:36.600 --> 00:12:39.150
and I feel very unsafe
walking down the street,

00:12:39.150 --> 00:12:40.440
just not armed.

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.577
Crime is on the rise in America,

00:12:41.577 --> 00:12:43.560
and I think one of the ways to stop crime

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:44.760
is by owning a gun.

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.010
- I definitely think that
there should be this control

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:49.320
in place to who buys guns.

00:12:49.320 --> 00:12:51.600
You couldn't just be able to
go to a store and buy a gun,

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.700
there should be regulations
into who buys guns,

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.983
and who shoots a gun.

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:00.930
- I actually debated whether
or not I was gonna sit down,

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.390
because I do believe people
have the right to bear arms.

00:13:03.390 --> 00:13:04.260
I do.

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.780
My issue is what kind
of arms they're bearing.

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:08.520
I believe people should get to go hunt,

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:11.193
but do you need a
semi-automatic rifle to do that?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:13.950
I'll tell you personally,
I'm afraid of guns,

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:15.180
personally myself.

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:18.270
But I just think there need
to be stricter regulations

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.103
with it.

00:13:19.103 --> 00:13:24.060
- But the majority of
people who die by gunshot,

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:26.370
are women in a domestic
violence situation.

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.320
So mass shootings definitely,

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.320
don't want automatic rifles,
against that, nobody needs 'em.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:34.500
But the most dangerous gun,
is the one in your home.

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.460
- I do wanna ask you a question.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.220
Do you think that women should
have the right to bear arms

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:41.190
to protect themselves?
- Yes, yeah.

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:44.460
I'm not against the right to own guns.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:48.747
The prompt was, do you think
owning a gun is a human right?

00:13:48.747 --> 00:13:50.520
And I don't agree with that.

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.420
- In my perspective,

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.460
I grew up in a gun riddled neighborhood.

00:13:53.460 --> 00:13:55.560
I myself am a gun owner now,

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.780
because of the fact that I had to create

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.400
some type of means of self-defense.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:00.870
So why did you disagree?

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:04.350
I disagree because I
would prefer not to be,

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.120
I think it's not a human right,

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.670
as much as almost a necessity
for a lot of people.

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:09.540
And not everyone,

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.010
there's a lot of neighborhoods
that are very safe,

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.410
but even in a safe
neighborhood, you can be robbed,

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:14.243
you can be killed.

00:14:14.243 --> 00:14:17.490
I've been stuck up several
times with a gun to my face,

00:14:17.490 --> 00:14:21.000
and all I could think
of is, "Man, if I die,

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.980
it's gonna be because
I didn't have a weapon

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:23.850
to help protect me."

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.440
- Do you think that we
should take away all guns

00:14:25.440 --> 00:14:26.430
from the entire world?

00:14:26.430 --> 00:14:28.610
- Yes, if there was like a
magnet, like magneto from "X-Men"

00:14:28.610 --> 00:14:30.810
and he just suck up all the guns,

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:33.060
I think that would be such a better place.

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.010
- [Narrator] My political opinions,

00:14:35.010 --> 00:14:38.553
have hurt my relationships
with friends and family.

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:48.660
- During 2020, when
America got really like

00:14:48.660 --> 00:14:50.700
politically intense, and my teacher,

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.590
she was very politically active,

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:54.600
