would get bullied after?

00:15:06.210 --> 00:15:08.550
- No. I'll just get looks.

00:15:08.550 --> 00:15:10.500
Some people come up and
say, "You're racist,

00:15:10.500 --> 00:15:11.760
or you're xenophobic."

00:15:11.760 --> 00:15:13.530
They would tell me, "Oh,
do you support Trump?"

00:15:13.530 --> 00:15:14.970
But I just brushed it off.

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.430
I told them, "Hey, I respect
that you think like this,

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.420
please respect me."

00:15:18.420 --> 00:15:19.833
- I think that that is,

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:22.950
whether or not we have the same ideas,

00:15:22.950 --> 00:15:25.530
I think that that is still
an admirable quality.

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:27.720
- Yeah.
- Despite getting looks,

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.150
or feeling like maybe you don't belong,

00:15:30.150 --> 00:15:31.370
that you're still...

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:34.160
You have your convictions.
- Yeah.

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:37.260
- So I can respect that you're convicted.

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:38.790
- Yeah.
(Cindy laughs)

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:40.620
- I think being liberal,

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.320
we think of the right as
being stuck in the sand.

00:15:43.320 --> 00:15:44.880
It's interesting to hear that liberals

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.010
were not having his right opinion.

00:15:47.010 --> 00:15:48.840
I think that everyone
should have their opinion.

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.940
- Well, I think we're talking about issues

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.890
that aren't a matter of opinion,

00:15:52.890 --> 00:15:55.650
but a matter of your morality,

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.480
the value of human lives.

00:15:57.480 --> 00:16:01.650
I've had to personally block
a few people on Facebook,

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:03.030
family members.
- Oh wow.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:05.460
- Mostly men that are married to the women

00:16:05.460 --> 00:16:06.540
